  "description": "The Savage All Mountain is perfect for advanced and expert skiers who thrive on variety and adaptability, providing excellent performance across diverse snow condition. They balance a blend of race tech and freeride construction to create a new quiver-of-one experience. The combination of a shorter turn radius and a wider waist makes for progressive carving in all terrain. The Savage ski collection features bold, animal-inspired graphics that bring the raw beauty of nature to life on the slopes. The leopard design showcases sleek, dynamic patterns evoking speed and agility, while the tiger graphics roar with fierce stripes and vibrant colors symbolizing power and strength. Reveal your Savage side !",
